<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for FC Mobile Tools by TanzimFC.">
  <article class="wrap legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">LEGAL</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">Last updated: September 12, 2026</p>

    <section><h2>1. Overview</h2><p>FC Mobile Tools, operated by TanzimFC, provides FC Mobile-related calculators, tools, trivia, guides, articles, and community resources. This Privacy Policy explains what information may be collected when you use this website and how it is used.</p></section>
    <section><h2>2. Information we collect</h2><p>Most features are designed to work without an account. We do not ask you to provide your name, address, phone number, or payment information to use the core tools.</p><p>Some features may store information locally in your browser, such as calculator settings, quiz progress, preferences, or tool results. This local data is controlled by your browser and is not automatically sent to us.</p></section>
    <section><h2>3. Analytics</h2><p>The site uses Google Analytics to understand general website usage, such as pages viewed, approximate usage patterns, and technical information supplied by the browser. Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies. We use this information to improve the website and understand which tools are useful.</p></section>
    <section><h2>4. Cookies and similar technologies</h2><p>FC Mobile Tools may use cookies or similar technologies through analytics and third-party services. You can control cookies through your browser settings. Blocking some cookies may affect certain website functionality.</p></section>
    <section><h2>5. Third-party services and links</h2><p>The website may link to third-party services including EA's redemption service, YouTube, Discord, X, and other external websites. Those services have their own privacy policies and terms. We are not responsible for how external services collect or use information after you leave FC Mobile Tools.</p></section>
    <section><h2>6. Children's privacy</h2><p>FC Mobile Tools is not intended to knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information to us directly, please contact us so the situation can be reviewed.</p></section>
    <section><h2>7. Data security</h2><p>We take reasonable steps to operate the website securely. However, no website or internet transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p></section>
    <section><h2>8. Your choices</h2><p>You can clear locally stored website data through your browser settings and manage cookies or analytics controls available in your browser. You may also stop using the website at any time.</p></section>
    <section><h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2><p>This Privacy Policy may be updated when the website, services, or applicable requirements change. The date at the top of this page indicates when it was last updated.</p></section>
    <section><h2>10. Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or concerns, use the official TanzimFC community channels listed on the <a href="/legal/contact">Contact</a> page.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
